//! generator pi, one element alpha_z of R with nrd(alpha_z) = pi for each
//! point z of P^1(O_F/p) (Dembélé 2005, section 3: T_p is a sum over
//! Theta(p) = {u in R : nrd(u) = pi} / R^x).
